1893..1968 Comment "/// A path at every word whose inverse arm drops its field\'s path: each arm"
1969..2045 Comment "/// checks at its constructor, but at `Loop(Unloop(x))` the loop arm carries"
2046..2122 Comment "/// the inverse arm\'s reflexivity to `here(x)`, which is not the path at `x`"
2123..2196 Comment "/// the rule\'s right side reads. Read as a set, the circle would identify"
2197..2246 Comment "/// the two; a presented type is not read as one."
